<title>USA: Omaha hogs $2.00 higher - USDA.</title>
<headline>Omaha hogs $2.00 higher - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were $2.00 higher. Top $62.00 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US  1-3    230-260 lbs    62.00</p>
<p>US  2-3    260-280 lbs    61.00-61.50</p>
<p>Sows: 20 percent. Fully tested, represented sales 0.50-1.00 higher. Top 47.75.</p>
<p>US 1-3    350-500 lbs    47.50-47.75</p>
<p>US 2-3    500-650 lbs    No test</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8723))</p>
</text>
